OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry evening with some clear spells.
OL,7,FOvernight will remain dry with some
OL,8,Fclear intervals but some areas of low
OL,9,Fcloud forming.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA mainly dry day with
OL,12,Fvariable cloud and some bright or
OL,13,Fsunny intervals. A few light showers
OL,14,Fpossible near North Channel coasts.
OL,15,FMild again.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,18,Fon Friday and Saturday with occasional
OL,19,Frain, perhaps brighter later Saturday.
OL,20,FThen Sunday dry with some sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
